==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|déviant}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈdiː.vi.ənt/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-I learned some phrases-deviant.wav|Audio (UK)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Characterized by deviation from an [[expectation]] or a [[social]] [[standard]].
#: ''At the trial, the extent of his '''deviant''' behavior became clear.''

